          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p><html:strong>Deprecated (2026-05-29).</html:strong> This investigation predates the Theme Studio redesign — most concrete claims here (single Dracula overlay, Inria Sans bundled fonts, <html:code><![CDATA[\meta{layout}{wide}]]></html:code> actually working) are no longer true. See <fr:link href="/sss-00C2/" title="Theme Studio — the current forest theme" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00C2/" display-uri="sss-00C2" type="local">Theme Studio — the current forest theme</fr:link> for the current architecture. Kept for historical context.</html:p>
            <html:p>Investigation note: how much of the forest's look — fonts, layout, home page, color — can I customize without forking the compiler? Inspired by <fr:link href="https://matteocapucci.eu/" type="external">Matteo Capucci's forest</fr:link>, whose home page and overall typography depart noticeably from the default Forester theme.</html:p>
