                <fr:source-path>/Users/stevenschaefer/forest/trees/sss-0099.tree</fr:source-path>
                <fr:title text="What's already customized here">What's already customized here</fr:title>
              </fr:frontmatter>
              <fr:mainmatter>
                <html:p>The current theme is the upstream Forester base theme plus a few local additions — see <html:code>theme/style.css</html:code> (~830 lines), the <fr:link href="/sss-0036/" title="Forking Forester" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-0036/" display-uri="sss-0036" type="local">Dracula theme</fr:link> overlay at <html:code>theme/themes/dracula.css</html:code>, the bundled Inria Sans <html:code>@font-face</html:code> declarations, and the dashboard's grid/column layout driven by <html:code><![CDATA[\meta{layout}{wide}]]></html:code>. The XSL pipeline (<html:code>default.xsl</html:code> → <html:code>core.xsl</html:code>, <html:code>tree.xsl</html:code>, <html:code>links.xsl</html:code>, <html:code>metadata.xsl</html:code>) is unchanged from upstream.</html:p>
              </fr:mainmatter>
            </fr:tree>
